-font\">Sold for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">(not bought by NPCs)</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcprice\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Bought for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">160 gp</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Magic Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"words\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Words</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"tibiatext tibiayellow\">adevo grav vita</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Field Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"lightcolor\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Light</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"colorbox\" style=\"background-color: #ffffff; width: 1em; height: 1em; display: inline-block;\"></span><span style=\"margin: 0 0 0 0.4em;\">1 sqm</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"walkable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Blocking</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Utility Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"usable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Usable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Unknown</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20170906122303&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Wild_Growth_Rune_434e1d.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a wild growth rune (\"adevo grav vita\").<div class=\"p-reqs\">It can only be used by druids with level 27 and magic level 8 or higher.<br/></div><div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 1.05 oz.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Wild Growth (Object)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Wild_Growth_Object_ed7a58.gif\" width=\"64\"/></span> Creates a rune to cast a tree which blocks off 1 square meter.\n</p><p>This spell is similar to a <a href=\"#/wiki/Magic%20Wall\">Magic Wall</a>: It creates a tree which lasts for 30 to 60 seconds and blocks one square meter. The main difference is that ammunition, spells and runes may also be shot through Wild Growth. \n</p><p>On Open PvP, Retro Open PvP, <a href=\"#/wiki/Hardcore%20PvP\">Hardcore PvP</a> and Retro Hardcore PvP words, they can be destroyed using a <a href=\"#/wiki/Heavy%20Machete\">Heavy Machete</a> or <a href=\"#/wiki/Machete\">Machete</a>. On <a href=\"#/wiki/Optional%20PvP\">Optional PvP</a> worlds they can be destroyed by walking over them. \n</p><p>The cost to make one of these runes with regular <a href=\"#/wiki/Mana%20Potion\">mana potions</a> and selling the vials is around 135 gps, so having the soul points and the time, it is better to make them with <a href=\"#/wiki/Mana%20Potion\">mana potions</a> than buy them on NPC. \n</p><p>For the spell, see Wild Growth.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div class=\"history-section\" id=\"w-object-history\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-History\">History</span></h3>\n<p>This rune became obtainable with the Summer Update 2008, until then Wild Growth an instant spell which would shoot one square in front of the caster, but was changed for more flexibility. \n</p><p>With the Autumn Patch 2009, they became passable on <a href=\"#/wiki/Optional%20PvP\">Optional PvP</a> Worlds. With the Update 10.00, the duration of the Wild Growth was changed from fixed 45 seconds to a random duration between 30 and 60 seconds <i>to make it more difficult to create \"permanent\" blockades</i>.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"w-cite_ref-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></sup> Then, with the 10.01 Update they were changed again, and became destroyed if a player walks over them (still only on Optional PvP).\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"w-cite_note-1\"><b>^</b> <span class=\"reference-text\">Post on official forum by a Community Manager.</span>\n</li>\n</ol></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul class=\"creature-list-generic no-results\"><li>This item is not dropped by any creatures.</li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\